WEBVTT

00:07:59.627 --> 00:08:04.037
fundamentally lacks the oversight
and accountability mechanisms

00:08:04.061 --> 00:08:05.467
that would be necessary

00:08:05.491 --> 00:08:09.093
to ensure it would not be abused
in the government's hands.

00:08:10.562 --> 00:08:15.474
First, face surveillance enables
a totalizing form of surveillance

00:08:15.498 --> 00:08:16.965
never before possible.

00:08:18.006 --> 00:08:21.966
Every single person's every visit
to a friend's house,

00:08:21.990 --> 00:08:23.553
a government office,

00:08:23.577 --> 00:08:25.664
a house of worship,

00:08:25.688 --> 00:08:27.101
a Planned Parenthood,

00:08:27.125 --> 00:08:28.625
a cannabis shop,

00:08:28.649 --> 00:08:30.116
a strip club;